<view><view class="card-box"><view class="title-wrapper"><text class="title-one">职位标签</text><text class="title-two">合适的职位标签有助于被检索，更有助于突出显示给候选人</text></view><view class="company-wrapper"><input class="company-input" type="text" model="{{tag}}" placeholder="请输入标签" placeholder-class="placeholder" maxlength="12" data-event-opts="{{[['input',[['enterMe',['$event']]]]]}}" value="{{tag}}" bindinput="__e"/><view data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['addTag']]]]}}" class="btn-add-wrapper" bindtap="__e"><text class="btn-add-words">添加</text></view></view><view class="line-wrapper" style="margin:20px 0;"><view class="line" style="width:100%;"></view></view><view class="tags-wrapper"><block wx:for="{{tagsArray}}" wx:for-item="t" wx:for-index="index" wx:key="index"><view class="tag-selected"><text class="tag-words-selected">{{t}}</text><image class="x" src="../../../static/icons/hr/tag-delete.png" data-event-opts="{{[['tap',[['deleteOneTag',[index]]]]]}}" bindtap="__e"></image></view></block></view></view></view>